# A second ignore file, and it is not redundant with the root one.
#
# Docker reads `.dockerignore` from the *build context* root, and this app's context is
# this directory (`docker build -f apps/extractor/Dockerfile apps/extractor`) — so the root
# file is never consulted for this image. Without this one, every build uploads the host's
# `.venv`: 164MB of macOS-linked wheels that could never run in a Linux image, sent over the
# daemon socket on every rebuild.
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache

# Never in an image (UC-6 rule 6). Secrets are injected by Fly from Doppler.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
